  "note": "Routes and controllers verified against source (kode-digital/bos-mirror) on 2026-08-28. Selectors are NOT yet filled in — that requires driving the live demo with Playwright (SPEC.md capture spec section) and is deferred until a capture spec is actually being written. This file establishes which URL maps to which real screen so fixtures.ts / capture specs target the right routes.",
